    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67335" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηθείς</span></b> , fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηθεμία</span> only in <i><span class="en">
